msgid ""
"Status of the delivery order on TikTok Shop:\n"
"- Awaiting Shipment: The order is ready for shipment, but nothing is shipped "
"yet.\n"
"- Awaiting Collection: The shipment is arranged and awaits carrier pickup.\n"
"- Delivered: The package has been collected by the carrier and is shipped.\n"
"- Canceled: The package has been cancelled.\n"
"- Manual handling required: Shipment must be rearranged and checked again in "
"TikTok Shop."
msgstr ""
"Status surat jalan di TikTok Shop:\n"
"- Menunggu Pengiriman: Pesanan sudah siap dikirim, tetapi belum ada barang "
"yang dikirim.\n"
"- Menunggu Penjemputan: Pengiriman sudah diatur dan menunggu penjemputan "
"oleh kurir.\n"
"- Dikirim: Paket telah dijemput oleh kurir dan sedang dalam perjalanan.\n"
"- Dibatalkan: Paket telah dibatalkan.\n"
"- Penanganan manual diperlukan: Pengiriman harus diatur ulang dan diperiksa "
"kembali di TikTok Shop."

